scratchpad/

# Cloudflare wrangler artifacts. Kept as ignore rules only, after the legacy
# Cloudflare Pages files were deleted on 2026-08-18: no wrangler config has ever
# existed in this repository, and these lines stop a stray local one from being
# committed and making the dead Workers build look intentional.
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example

__pycache__/
*.pyc
